<title>UK: Powergen to buy rest of Kinetica.</title>
<headline>Powergen to buy rest of Kinetica.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British utility group Powergen Plc said on Thursday that it will pay 18 million stg to assume full ownership of Kinetica on April 1.</p>
<p>Kinetica is jointly owned by Powergen and Conoco (UK) Ltd.  </p>
<p>Powergen said that the 18 million stg will be paid in cash as a loan repayment. Kinetica is an independent gas retailer.</p>
<p>Powergen and Conoco have also agreed to divide Kinetica's gas purchase contracts between them on an equitable basis.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom + 44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
